// UNKNOWN complete King loot weight set; no weight is an authentic period rarity.
// Transfer later same-item probabilities to 1/128 units, round to the nearest integer,
// retain a minimum weight of 1; prefer the same King, then another King, else use 1.
// This support-preserving quantization and final normalization are engineering choices.
// Generic gems: round(10 * 58 / 128) = 5; half keys: round((8 * 40 + 10 * 2) / 128) = 3.
// The outer 8/128 and 10/128 later slots and native conditional groups are donors only.
// Prime herb-seed slot uses the later 7/128 weight; its native conditional table below
// excludes non-herb seeds. Integer lists/ranges use native uniform selection, UNKNOWN.
// Missing quantities select one item, also UNKNOWN rather than an unstated source fact.
^wbk_unstated_loot_quantity = 1

